<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait's Gulf Bank '96 net rises 23 pct.</title>
<headline>Kuwait's Gulf Bank '96 net rises 23 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-05-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			    (Million dinars unless stated)</p>
<p>					1996	   1995</p>
<p> Net profit		     31.349	 25.532</p>
<p> Interest income		98.092	 94.710</p>
<p> Loan provisions		 0.785	  1.843</p>
<p> Total dividend		 23.684	 19.864</p>
<p>Full name: The Gulf Bank KSC</p>
<p>Note: The bank's general assembly approved a 31 percent dividend for 1996 compared to 26 percent in 1995.</p>
</text>
